{"seq":2,"slug":"release-and-transition","title":"获释与谈判","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/nelson-mandela/major-events/release-and-transition","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"walking-to-freedom","title":"走向自由","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/nelson-mandela/major-events/release-and-transition/walking-to-freedom","wordCount":1575,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"the-negotiated-revolution","title":"谈判中的革命","url":"/l-doc-books/c/leaders/nelson-mandela/major-events/release-and-transition/the-negotiated-revolution","wordCount":1828,"readingTime":8}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"获释与谈判\">获释与谈判</h1><p>曼德拉的获释与随后的谈判，开启了南非和平转型。本章追溯这一历程。</p>\n<p>第一篇文档讲述&quot;走向自由&quot;——他走出监狱、重获自由这一历史性时刻及其意义。第二篇文档讲述&quot;谈判中的革命&quot;,呈现南非如何通过谈判而非内战实现深刻变革。</p>\n"}